{"seq":3,"slug":"shared-memory-bank-conflict-occupancy","title":"Shared Memory bank conflict 与占用率延迟隐藏调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/simt-execution-memory-hierarchy/shared-memory-bank-conflict-occupancy","wordCount":2540,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"shared-memory-bank-conflict-与占用率延迟隐藏调优\">Shared Memory bank conflict 与占用率延迟隐藏调优</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CUDA 的片上共享内存（shared memory）被切成固定数量的<strong>bank</strong>。自 compute capability 5.x 起，每个 SM 的共享内存有 <strong>32 个 bank，每个 bank 每时钟周期带宽 32 bit</strong>，连续的 32-bit 字依次映射到连续 bank（NVIDIA, <em>CUDA C Programming Guide</em>, §5.x shared memory）。一个 warp 也是 32 线程，于是 bank 与 lane 天然一一对应：lane <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 访问的字落在 bank <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i \\bmod 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>一次 warp 的共享内存请求会被硬件拆成若干次无冲突的事务。<strong>如果同一个 bank 被两个或更多 lane 访问到不同的地址，这些访问就被串行化</strong>——这就是 bank conflict。唯一例外是<strong>多个 lane 访问同一地址</strong>，此时硬件广播一份数据给所有请求者，不算冲突。判定规则：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>lane </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>bank</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost} = \\max_b |\\{\\text{lane } i : \\text{bank}(addr_i) = b\\}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lane </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bank</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">dd</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，取值为 1（或同地址被多处引用）时无冲突。</p>\n<p>占用率（occupancy）是另一个正交的量，衡量 SM 上<strong>实际驻留的 warp 数占硬件上限的比例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>occupancy</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>active warps per SM</mtext><mtext>max warps per SM</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{occupancy} = \\frac{\\text{active warps per SM}}{\\text{max warps per SM}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">occupancy</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max warps per SM</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">active warps per SM</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在 Ampere <code>sm_80</code>、Hopper <code>sm_90</code>、Blackwell <code>sm_100</code> 上，硬件上限都是 <strong>64 warps/SM</strong>（即 2048 线程），寄存器堆 <strong>64K 个 32-bit 寄存器/SM</strong>，单线程最多 <strong>255 个寄存器</strong>，最多 <strong>32 个 thread block/SM</strong>（NVIDIA, <em>Ampere Tuning Guide</em>; <em>Hopper Tuning Guide</em>; <em>Blackwell Tuning Guide</em>）。bank conflict 决定单条指令的吞吐，占用率决定有多少 warp 可供切换。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[Warp 发出 shared load] --&gt; B{同 bank 不同地址?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[单事务完成&lt;br/&gt;broadcast 亦在此]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[拆成 N 次事务&lt;br/&gt;串行化]&#10;  C --&gt; E[占用率决定&lt;br/&gt;可切换的 warp 数]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{延迟能否被隐藏?}&#10;  F --&gt;|warp 足够| G[SM 吞吐饱和]&#10;  F --&gt;|warp 不足| H[发射停顿&lt;br/&gt;memory throttle]\">graph TD\n  A[Warp 发出 shared load] --&gt; B{同 bank 不同地址?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[单事务完成&lt;br/&gt;broadcast 亦在此]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[拆成 N 次事务&lt;br/&gt;串行化]\n  C --&gt; E[占用率决定&lt;br/&gt;可切换的 warp 数]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{延迟能否被隐藏?}\n  F --&gt;|warp 足够| G[SM 吞吐饱和]\n  F --&gt;|warp 不足| H[发射停顿&lt;br/&gt;memory throttle]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>A100 <code>sm_80</code></th>\n<th>H100 <code>sm_90</code></th>\n<th>B200 <code>sm_100</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享内存 / SM</td>\n<td>164 KB</td>\n<td>228 KB</td>\n<td>228 KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每 block 上限</td>\n<td>163 KB</td>\n<td>227 KB</td>\n<td>227 KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大 warp / SM</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>寄存器 / SM</td>\n<td>64K</td>\n<td>64K</td>\n<td>64K</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中数据来自 NVIDIA 各代 tuning guide；<strong>静态声明的共享内存数组仍被限制在 48 KB</strong>，超过必须走动态共享内存并显式 opt-in（A100 与 H100 均保留每 block 1 KB 预留，故 164 KB→163 KB、228 KB→227 KB）。Hopper 相对 A100 的共享内存增长约 39%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bank-conflict-的判定与常见触发模式\">Bank conflict 的判定与常见触发模式</h2><p>bank conflict 的典型来源不是随机访存，而是<strong>有规律的行列访问</strong>。设一块按行主序存放的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32 \\times 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span> float 矩阵，行内步长恰好是 32 个字。当 warp 去取某一列（lane <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 取第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 行第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 列）时：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>bank</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{bank}(i) = (i \\cdot 32 + j) \\bmod 32 = j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bank</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>32 个 lane 全部落在 bank <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 上，退化为 <strong>32-way conflict</strong>，一条指令被拆成 32 次事务——比无冲突慢 32 倍。转置、矩阵乘的 tile 加载、Stencil 的 halo 读取都会踩到这个坑。判定法则：stride 为奇数即安全（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>32</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(s,32)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span>cd</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>32</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{i \\cdot s \\bmod 32\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 遍历全部 bank）；stride 是 32 的倍数最糟；偶数但非 32 倍数介于两者之间。</p>\n<p>访问宽度也会改变结论：以 <strong>128-bit（float4）访问</strong>为例，一条指令天然占用 4 个连续 bank 位置，此时 warp 被分成 4 组、每组 8 lane，无冲突的条件变为「每组 8 lane 落在 8 个互不重叠的 4-word 段上」。所以<strong>向量化访存既是提升带宽的手段，也会重新划分冲突判定的边界</strong>。</p>\n<p>排查时不要靠推理，用 Nsight Compute 的 <code>l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_ld</code> 与 <code>..._op_st</code> 直接读冲突次数，再对照 <code>..._wavefronts</code> 看平均每个请求被拆成几波。</p>\n<h2 id=\"padding-swizzle-与向量化-消除冲突的三类手法\">Padding、Swizzle 与向量化：消除冲突的三类手法</h2><p><strong>Padding（填充）</strong> 是最经典的手法。把上面的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32 \\times 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵每行从 32 个 float 扩展到 33 个：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cuda\" data-code=\"__shared__ float tile[32][33];   // 行步长 33，与 32 互质\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>__shared__ float tile[32][33];   // 行步长 33，与 32 互质</span></span></code></pre></div><p>此时列访问的 bank 变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>bank</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{bank}(i) = (i \\cdot 33 + j) \\bmod 32 = (i + j) \\bmod 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bank</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span>。lane <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 落在 bank <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(i+j)\\bmod 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span>，遍历全部 32 个 bank，冲突归零。代价是每 32 行多出一行 4 字节存储，浪费约 3% 共享内存——通常是划算的。对 128-bit 向量访问，对应技巧是把行步长调整为 32 个 float4 加一个 float4 的空隙。</p>\n<p><strong>Swizzle（异或置换）</strong> 是 padding 的现代替代，在寄存器受限或需要精确控制布局时使用。核心思想不是&quot;多加一行&quot;，而是让<strong>列索引与行索引做异或</strong>，把同一列打散到不同 bank：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>col</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>col</mtext><mo>⊕</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>row</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>32</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{col}&#x27; = \\text{col} \\oplus (\\text{row} \\bmod 32)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8362em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">col</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8362em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">col</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">row</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这样无论按行还是按列访问，落在同一 bank 的 lane 都不会指向不同地址。Triton 生成 attention、matmul 的共享内存布局时正是用 swizzle 而非 padding，因为 block 级 tile 的尺寸由编译器在编译期推导，padding 会打乱其确定的形状（Triton 编译器的 <code>swizzled_shared</code> 布局）。</p>\n<p><strong>调整访问宽度</strong>是第三条路。把 32 次标量访问改成 8 次 128-bit 访问，冲突判定从&quot;32 lane × 1 word&quot;变成&quot;8 lane × 4 word&quot;，很多原本 2-way 的冲突会直接消失。前提是地址对齐——共享内存的 float4 访问要求 16 字节对齐，<code>__shared__</code> 数组起始对齐、padding 到 4 的倍数即可满足。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[列访问 32-way 冲突] --&gt; A[Padding&lt;br/&gt;步长 32→33]&#10;  P --&gt; B[Swizzle&lt;br/&gt;col XOR row]&#10;  P --&gt; C[向量化&lt;br/&gt;标量→float4]&#10;  A --&gt; S[无冲突]&#10;  B --&gt; S&#10;  C --&gt; S\">graph TD\n  P[列访问 32-way 冲突] --&gt; A[Padding&lt;br/&gt;步长 32→33]\n  P --&gt; B[Swizzle&lt;br/&gt;col XOR row]\n  P --&gt; C[向量化&lt;br/&gt;标量→float4]\n  A --&gt; S[无冲突]\n  B --&gt; S\n  C --&gt; S</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>典型收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Padding</td>\n<td>手工 CUDA，规则 tile</td>\n<td>约 3% 共享内存</td>\n<td>32-way → 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Swizzle</td>\n<td>Triton/编译器生成布局</td>\n<td>逻辑复杂，需匹配消费端</td>\n<td>32-way → 0（无空间开销）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量化</td>\n<td>对齐可行的连续访问</td>\n<td>对齐约束、寄存器压力</td>\n<td>冲突度降低 2–4 倍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"占用率的计算与寄存器压力\">占用率的计算与寄存器压力</h2><p>占用率不是越高越好，但它有一个<strong>下限</strong>——低于这个下限，延迟就藏不住。计算占用率时，限制来自四个约束中的<strong>最紧一个</strong>：每 block 的线程数、共享内存、寄存器用量、以及每 SM 的 block 数上限（32）。</p>\n<p>先算寄存器约束。若每线程用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 个寄存器，block 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 个线程，则以 256 为分配粒度向上取整：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>regs per block</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mn>256</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{regs per block} = \\left\\lceil \\frac{R \\cdot T}{256} \\right\\rceil \\cdot 256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">regs per block</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>再看共享内存约束。每 block 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 字节时：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>blocks per SM</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>32</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>64</mn><mtext>K regs</mtext></mrow><mtext>regs per block</mtext></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>228</mn><mtext> KB</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> KB</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{blocks per SM} = \\min\\left(32,\\ \\left\\lfloor\\frac{64\\text{K regs}}{\\text{regs per block}}\\right\\rfloor,\\ \\left\\lfloor\\frac{228\\text{ KB}}{S + 1\\text{ KB}}\\right\\rfloor\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">blocks per SM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">regs per block</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">K regs</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> KB</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">228</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> KB</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>那个 <strong>+1 KB 是 CUDA 为每个 block 保留的固定开销</strong>（NVIDIA 文档明确写出），在 Hopper/Blackwell 上不可忽略。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>227</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = 227</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">227</span></span></span></span></span> KB，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mn>228</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>228</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor 228/228 \\rfloor = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\">228/228</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，SM 上只能驻留 1 个 block——若单 block 只有 256 线程，占用率就只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2048</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">256/2048 = 12.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256/2048</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12.5%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>寄存器压力往往是更隐蔽的杀手。<code>-maxrregcount</code> 或 <code>__launch_bounds__</code> 可强制编译器把每线程寄存器压到某个上限，从而提升占用率；但压缩寄存器会引入<strong>溢出（spill）</strong>，把变量挤到 local memory，反而增加访存。判断该不该压，看 Nsight Compute 的 <code>launch__registers_per_thread</code> 与 <code>sm__warps_active.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_active</code>：若后者已经很高，再压寄存器就是负收益。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cuda\" data-code=\"__global__ void __launch_bounds__(256, 4) k(...) { ... }&#10;// 256 线程/block，请求每 SM 至少 4 个 block → 至多 64 寄存器/线程\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>__global__ void __launch_bounds__(256, 4) k(...) { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 256 线程/block，请求每 SM 至少 4 个 block → 至多 64 寄存器/线程</span></span></code></pre></div><p>共享内存的占用则取决于 <strong>carveout</strong>。Hopper/Blackwell 上共享内存与 L1/纹理共用 256 KB 物理 SRAM，可选配置为 <strong>0, 8, 16, 32, 64, 100, 132, 164, 196, 228 KB</strong>（A100 为 0, 8, 16, 32, 64, 100, 132, 164 KB）。用 <code>cudaFuncSetAttribute(kernel, cudaFuncAttributePreferredSharedMemoryCarveout, ...)</code> 或对动态共享内存设 <code>cudaFuncAttributeMaxDynamicSharedMemorySize</code> 声明。carveout 给大了，L1 就小了——对 L1 命中率敏感的 kernel 是一个实实在在的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟隐藏-占用率与其他手段的权衡\">延迟隐藏：占用率与其他手段的权衡</h2><p>延迟隐藏的本质是<strong>并发度必须覆盖延迟</strong>：一条访存指令的往返延迟约数百个时钟周期，而一个 warp 发射一条指令只需几个周期，所以在途的并发请求数必须足够多：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mtext>latency</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>issue interval</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\approx \\text{latency} / \\text{issue interval}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">latency</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">issue interval</span></span></span></span></span></span>。占用率提供的是<strong>线程级并行（TLP）</strong>——warp 越多，可切换的候选越多。但同一份&quot;并发度预算&quot;还有另外两个来源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指令级并行（ILP）</strong>：一个线程内多条独立访存可同时在途。4 线程 × 每线程 4 条独立 load，与 16 线程 × 每线程 1 条 load，隐藏延迟的效果可能相同。</li>\n<li><strong>异步拷贝</strong>：<code>cp.async</code>（Ampere 起）把 global→shared 拷贝从寄存器旁路掉，硬件直接搬运，不占用寄存器，也不阻塞发出它的线程（NVIDIA, <em>Ampere Tuning Guide</em>）。Hopper 的 <strong>TMA（Tensor Memory Accelerator）</strong> 更进一步：单线程即可发起 1D 到 5D 的大块传输，在 global 与 shared 间双向搬运，还能做 cluster 内跨 SM 的 shared→shared 拷贝，并<strong>完全避免用寄存器搬数据</strong>（NVIDIA, <em>Hopper Tuning Guide</em>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者可以互相替代，这就是&quot;占用率调优&quot;的核心洞察：<strong>不要把占用率当目标，要把延迟隐藏当目标</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一个<strong>访存受限</strong>的 kernel（如纯拷贝、Stencil），提高占用率通常直接见效。</li>\n<li>一个<strong>计算受限</strong>、且已用 TMA/<code>cp.async</code> 做异步预取的 kernel（如 Ampere 之后的标准 GEMM），即使占用率只有 25%–50%，也能靠软件流水把延迟完全藏住——此时再牺牲寄存器换占用率是负优化。</li>\n<li>一个<strong>寄存器密集</strong>的 kernel（如大型 matmul 的累加器 tile），寄存器压力本身就限制了占用率；<code>__launch_bounds__</code> 强行压低会引入 spill，反而更慢。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实务上先用 Nsight Compute 判断瓶颈：<code>sm__throughput</code> 与 <code>gpu__dram_throughput</code> 的比值告诉你更接近计算受限还是访存受限；<code>smsp__warp_issue_stalled_long_scoreboard</code> 高说明在等内存，此时才轮到提占用率；<code>..._mio_throttle</code> 或 <code>l1tex__data_bank_conflicts</code> 高则说明共享内存子系统本身是瓶颈。用 <code>cudaOccupancyMaxActiveBlocksPerMultiprocessor</code> 可在运行时拿到理论驻留 block 数，与实测值对照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>bank conflict</strong>：32 banks × 32-bit，<code>bank = addr/4 mod 32</code>；同 bank 不同地址串行化，同地址广播免费。判定式就是每 bank 的 lane 计数最大值。</li>\n<li><strong>三类消除手法</strong>：padding（步长改 33 或奇数）、swizzle（col XOR row，Triton 编译器默认）、向量化（改访问宽度，需 16 字节对齐）。padding 有约 3% 空间代价，swizzle 无空间开销但要求布局匹配。</li>\n<li><strong>占用率</strong>受寄存器、共享内存、block 数上限三重约束；<code>+1 KB/block</code> 的保留量在 Hopper 的 228 KB 上是真实开销。</li>\n<li><strong>延迟隐藏才是目的</strong>：TLP（占用率）、ILP（线程内并行）、异步拷贝（<code>cp.async</code>/TMA）三者可互换。计算受限且已做软件流水的 kernel 不需要高占用率。</li>\n<li><strong>先测后调</strong>：Nsight Compute 的 <code>bank_conflicts</code>、<code>wavefronts</code>、<code>registers_per_thread</code>、<code>warp_issue_stalled_long_scoreboard</code> 是四条入口指标；<code>__launch_bounds__</code> 与 carveout 是最后手段，二者都可能引入 spill 或牺牲 L1。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>章节内相关：共享内存的 bank 冲突解决的是<strong>片上</strong>访问效率，而 global memory 的合并访问（coalescing）解决的是<strong>片外</strong>带宽效率，两者常需配合调优，见同章节的 <a href=\"gpu-memory-hierarchy-coalescing\"><code>2_gpu-memory-hierarchy-coalescing.md</code></a>。完整文档序列见 <a href=\"./\"><code>INDEX.md</code></a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Shared Memory bank conflict 与占用率延迟隐藏调优","id":"shared-memory-bank-conflict-与占用率延迟隐藏调优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Bank conflict 的判定与常见触发模式","id":"bank-conflict-的判定与常见触发模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Padding、Swizzle 与向量化：消除冲突的三类手法","id":"padding-swizzle-与向量化-消除冲突的三类手法"},{"level":2,"text":"占用率的计算与寄存器压力","id":"占用率的计算与寄存器压力"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟隐藏：占用率与其他手段的权衡","id":"延迟隐藏-占用率与其他手段的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GPU 显存层级与全局内存合并访问建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/simt-execution-memory-hierarchy/gpu-memory-hierarchy-coalescing"},"next":{"title":"CUDA thread/block/grid 映射与 kernel 骨架设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/cuda-kernel-programming-optimization/cuda-grid-block-thread-mapping"}}